  "evidence": "Food & Drink at The Prince Albert | Pub Food in Battersea Gift Vouchers Book Now Find Us 85 Albert Bridge Road, London, SW11 4PF 02072280923 princealbert@youngs.co.uk Opening Times Monday - Saturday 11am - 11pm Sunday 12pm - 10.30pm Food Service Times Monday - Saturday 12pm - 9.30pm Sunday 12pm - 9pm Social Work With Us Privacy Policy Young & Co.&#x27;s Brewery, P.L.C. Place of registration: England and Wales. Registered number: 32762 Registered office: Copper House, 5 Garratt Lane, Wandsworth, London, SW18 4AQ By Propeller The best in Battersea Classic British Pub Food Treat your tastebuds to our Festive Menus Try our famous Sunday Roasts Raise a glass to our Winter Cocktails Celebrate with our Events Menus We Are Open Monday 11am - 11pm View all times Food Served 12pm - 9.30pm Find Us 85 Albert Bridge Road, London, SW11 4PF View on a map Food & Drink in Battersea Park There has never been a better time to enjoy our stunning seasonal menu. With our wide selection of British meats and our Battersea-famous Sunday roasts, there’s something to cater to even the trickiest taste buds. Planning a party? Check out our events menus to see how we can cater to your big day. Can’t see what you’re looking for? Feel free to get in touch with our team and we’ll see what we can do! PARTIES & EVENTS Sunday Roasts Fed up of feeling a bit worse-for-wear every Sunday morning? Banish your hangover with an Absolut Tabasco Bloody Mary and our famous roast dinner. Your choice of meat coupled with golden roasties, seasonal veg, an enormous Yorkshire pud and a sea of rich gravy – what could be better than that? BOOK YOUR ROAST Winter Cocktails There’s only one way to get through a cold, grey winter… sip your way through our brand new cocktail menu! Whether you’re into Old Fashioneds or Lychee Margaritas, you’ll find your new favourite in no time. JOIN US FOR A DRINK Festive Menus Treat yourself to the best festive offering around and join us for dinner this Christmas. With tantalising three-course menus, flavour-filled sharing boards and a magnificent Christmas Day feast, your tastebuds will thank you for it! SEASONS EATINGS Drink Alcohol Free & Low Alcohol Wine List Winter Cocktails Food All Day Menu Bar Snacks & Sharers Children&#x27;s Menu Puddings Sandwich Menu Sunday Menu Christmas Festive Feast Menu Christmas Day Menu Festive Sharers Alcohol Free & Low Alcohol Filter By: Vegan Vegetarian Soft Drinks Appletiser £3.80 275ml Coca Cola £3.80 330ml Diet Coke £3.70 330ml Kingsdown Still/Sparkling Water £3.25 330ml Kingsdown Still/Sparkling Water £5.50 750ml Red Bull £4.35 250ml Fever-Tree Mixers Light Ginger Ale £3.35 200ml Light Ginger Beer £3.35 200ml Indian Tonic £3.45 200ml Light Tonic £3.35 200ml Sicilian Lemonade £4.35 200ml Raspberry Lemonade £4.35 200ml Summer Sipping Tanqueray Gin 0% £4.60 35ml Tropical Pineapple, Coconut, Apple, Soda £4.35 Lime & Mint £5.35 Lime, Mint, Orange Blossom, Raspberry Soda Raspberry & Rose £4.35 Fever-Tree Raspberry & Rose Lemonade Sicilian Lemon £4.35 Fever-Tree Sicillian Lemonade TRIP Blood Orange & Rosemary £4.85 Magnesium, Lion's Mane, Ashwagandha TRIP CBD Peach & Ginger £4.85 Ginseng, Turmeric, Lemon Balm Social Iced Tea £5.35 Three Spirit Social, Lion's Mane, Lemonade Steinbock Riesling Sparkling Wine £36 Germany Nooh La Coste Alcohol-Free Rosé Provence £9 Low Alcohol & Alcohol-Free Bottles Beavertown Lazer Crush IPA £5.40 0.3% Rekordelig Strawberry & Lime £5.95 0% Peroni Nastro Azzuro 0% £5.15 Lucky St Unfiltered 0.5% £5.65 Erdinger Alkoholfrei 0% £5.05 Guinness 0% £6.25 Asahi 0% £5.15 Corona Cero 0% £4.95 We visited on 5 July for Sunday roasts. Everything about this pub was excellent. Staff were brilliant all round and the food was perfect. I had brought a friend visiting from America and the Prince Albert did not disappoint. Thank you to all the staff that looked after us. N Delicious Sunday roast meal at Prince Albert. Top notch service and generous portions. They also have a great selection of non alcoholic beers (and a couple of non alcoholic sparkling wines) for the teetotalers out there. Highly recommend this place for classic British roast. The Yorkshire pudding is A+. Kevin Super service from Will and Jeremy. We got the roast, beef and chicken - it was unbelievable. Such good value for money, very good portion sizes and cooked to perfection. Would strongly recommend. Aman FAQs Where can I get a Sunday roast in Battersea? The Prince Albert is a popular spot for Sunday roasts in Battersea, serving traditional roasts with all the trimmings including roast potatoes, Yorkshire puddings and seasonal vegetables. What type of food does The Prince Albert serve? The Prince Albert serves classic British pub food including fish & chips, short rib burgers and traditional Sunday roasts. Does The Prince Albert serve cocktails? Yes, we serve a range of cocktails and spritzes including Espresso Martinis, Aperol Spritzes and Hugo Spritzes. Can I book a table for food at The Prince Albert? Yes, you can book a table at The Prince Albert for food and drinks. Booking is recommended, especially on weekends and before live sports. Do you offer vegetarian options? Yes, The Prince Albert offers several vegetarian options as part of its menu, including meat-free alternatives for Sunday roasts. VIEW MORE",
